            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the case of a 37-year-old construction executive presenting with chest pain, shortness of breath, and dizziness on exertion secondary to a giant left subclavian artery aneurysm and aortic valvular disease.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
